# 🤖 Face Recognition With ML And Flask App

## 🚀 Project Overview
A dynamic **Web Application** built with **Flask** that implements **Face Recognition** using **Machine Learning**.  
The system detects, encodes, and identifies human faces from images or real-time video streams.  

This project combines **computer vision** and **ML classification** to deliver a scalable solution for tasks such as **attendance tracking**, **authentication**, or **personalized user experiences**.

---

## 🛠️ Technology Stack

| Library / Framework          | Purpose                                                                                                     |
| :--------------------------- | :---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |
| **Flask**                    | Web framework for routing and serving HTML templates.                                                       |
| **OpenCV** (`opencv-python`) | Face detection, video stream capture, and image processing.                                                 |
| **scikit-learn**             | Classification model (e.g., K-Nearest Neighbors) for face encodings.                                        |
| **NumPy**                    | Numerical operations and handling image data as arrays.                                                     |
| **Pandas**                   | Data management, user/face databases, and attendance logs.                                                  |
| **Matplotlib**               | Visualization and debugging.                                                                                |
| **Gunicorn**                 | Production-ready WSGI server for deploying Flask apps.                                                      |
| **Pillow**                   | Image manipulation and preprocessing.                                                                       |

